  <gmx:scope>
    <gco:CharacterString>The document lists statistics, key fields, and data choices in each tier’s assessment unit (AU) feature class (GIS dataset). It also provides the final combined AU feature class (EVOS_AUs_Lingering_Oil_Status_All_Tiers) developed by applying the tiered data approach in the Lingering Oil Listing Methodology to define each AU as Attaining, Impaired, or Unknown (not enough information).</gco:CharacterString>
